    <h1>The whole board, seen clearly.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Advisory for development, asset decisions, and capital strategy from someone who has built and operated the real thing. Build, buy, hold, sell, restructure, or walk away &mdash; the big decisions are won or lost long before the paperwork.</p>
